			(property "Description" "Multiband universal GNSS receiver front end: high band (L1/E1/B1/G1, LO 1525-1610 MHz) or low band (L2/L5/E5/E6/B2/B3, LO 1160-1290 MHz), one band at a time; complex IF 2.5/4.2/8.7 MHz or lowpass 16.4/23.4/36 MHz; 1-3 bit ADC to 44 MHz, external ADC clock input; fractional-N synthesizer, reference 8-44 MHz; 3-wire SPI (readable); 28-TQFN 5x5 EP"
